OL,3,AUS envoys arrive in Moscow ahead of
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of US President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fenvoys have arrived in Moscow ahead of
OL,8,Fa weekend of talks aimed at
OL,9,Faccelerating efforts to end the war in
OL,10,FUkraine.
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner are
OL,13,Fholding talks in the Russian capital
OL,14,Fbefore travelling to Kyiv on Sunday for
OL,15,Fdiscussions with Ukraine.
OL,17,FTrump told reporters on Friday that
OL,18,FWitkoff and Kushner were "bringing with
OL,19,Fthem a proposal to end the war". So
OL,20,Ffar, efforts from the US and its allies
OL,21,Fto broker a peace deal have failed to
OL,22,Fdeliver a breakthrough.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
